    {
      "id": "BB-DOC-003",
      "area": "doctor",
      "purpose": "doctor connects to the configured host (loopback mock receives a connection)",
      "source": "docs/guide/ja/cli-reference.md#フラグ一覧",
      "setup": [
        "exec 3< <(python3 -I -c '\nimport os, signal, socket, sys\n\nhits = 0\n\ndef stop(*_):\n    raise SystemExit\n\nsignal.signal(signal.SIGTERM, stop)\nserver = socket.socket()\nserver.bind((\"127.0.0.1\", 0))\nserver.listen(8)\nserver.settimeout(float(sys.argv[1]))\nprint(server.getsockname()[1], os.getpid(), flush=True)\ntry:\n    while True:\n        conn, _ = server.accept()\n        hits += 1\n        conn.close()\n        print(\"hit\", flush=True)\nexcept (SystemExit, socket.timeout):\n    pass\nfinally:\n    print(\"hits=%d\" % hits, flush=True)\n' 30)\nread -r -t 20 -u 3 PORT MPID || { echo MOCK_NOT_READY; exit 1; }"
      ],
      "command": "\"$BIN\" --doctor --ollama-host \"http://127.0.0.1:$PORT\" </dev/null >\"$T/d.out\" 2>&1; echo doctor_rc=$?\nread -r -t 20 -u 3 HIT || echo MOCK_NO_HIT\nkill -TERM \"$MPID\"\nread -r -t 20 -u 3 REPORT || echo MOCK_NO_REPORT\nread -r -t 20 -u 3 _ || true\necho \"$REPORT\"\ncat \"$T/d.out\"",
      "timeout_sec": 60,
      "expected": {
        "exit_code": 0,
        "stdout_contains": [
          "doctor_rc=1",
          "hits=",
          "CommandAgent doctor: failed",
          "✗ Ollama",
          "/api/tags unreachable",
          "doctor found failed checks"
        ],
        "stderr_contains": [],
        "must_not_contain": [
          "panicked at",
          "hits=0",
          "MOCK_NOT_READY",
          "MOCK_NO_HIT",
          "MOCK_NO_REPORT"
        ],
        "files_exist": [],
        "files_absent": []
      },
      "note": "Audit expectation (doctor makes no network request) is obsolete: cli-reference.md:70 says --doctor checks the provider host. The case now expects a connection to a case-owned loopback mock (OS-assigned port, ready line, deadline, stopped and collected before the case ends); the mock closes the connection, so the Ollama check fails and doctor exits 1."
    },
